  <div id="sutta">
  
            <h4 id="thag2.19" class="h1">Thag 2:19  Nanda</h4>

<div class="verse">
<pre>
From inappropriate attention
I was devoted to ornament,
	restless &amp; vain,
driven by sensual passion.
</pre>
<pre>
With the help of the Buddha,
the Kinsman of the Sun,
skilled in strategies,
I, practicing appropriately,
	plucked my mind
out of becoming.
</pre>
</div><!--end verse-->
<p class="seealso">See also: <a href="../../SN/SN21_8.html" class="sutta-ref">SN 21:8</a>; <a href="../../AN/AN8_9.html" class="sutta-ref">AN 8:9</a>; <a href="../Ud/ud3_2.html" class="sutta-ref">Ud 3:2</a></p>
      </div><!--end:sutta-->
